OL,3,AUK set for coldest night of autumn so
OL,4,Afar
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter a spell of unusually warm
OL,7,Fweather, temperatures across the UK are
OL,8,Fset to tumble with the coldest night of
OL,9,Fautumn so far arriving by midweek.
OL,11,FWednesday night will bring the first
OL,12,Ffrost of the season to some places, as
OL,13,Fcolder air arrives from the Arctic.
OL,15,FIn some areas, minimum temperatures
OL,16,Fcould be just a degree or two above
OL,17,Ffreezing by dawn on Thursday.
OL,19,FAlong with the plummeting temperatures,
OL,20,Fsome much-needed rainfall is on the way
OL,21,Ffor England and Wales.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
